    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d183">

                <pb facs="0204" n="130" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp02v01/pg130"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/5881</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Special Agent</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Morgenthau</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                        </hi><anchor n="3" xml:id="d183-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-07-17T16:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 17, 1917, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 11.45 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your 2446, 14th. Please assure the President that nothing done or said that in
                    the remotest degree exceeds instructions. There is <pb facs="0205" n="131"
                        xml:id="pg131"/> no cause for the President or you to feel disturbed. Under
                    all the circumstances it is most desirable that Frankfurter make a detailed
                    report orally. Frankfurter therefore will return. I shall rest with my wife at
                    Aix-les-Bains prepared to proceed to Cairo if after hearing report of
                    Frankfurter the President still desires me to go.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Morgenthau</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d183-f1" n="3" type="source" xml:id="d183-f1-content">
                <p>Transmitted through the Ambassador in France, in telegram No. 2299.</p>
            </note>
